2026-11-27T18:50:55.7597860Z   brew install lld
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7598220Z   brew install lldb
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7598400Z 
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7598690Z Z3 solver support will be removed in LLVM 24 as it is unsupported upstream,
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7599480Z see https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/205370
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7599740Z 
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7600060Z Using `clang`, `clang++`, etc., requires a CLT installation at `/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools`.
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7600850Z If you don't want to install the CLT, you can write appropriate configuration files pointing to your
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7605560Z SDK at ~/.config/clang.
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7605780Z 
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7606020Z To use the bundled libunwind please use the following LDFLAGS:
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7606570Z   LDFLAGS="-L/opt/homebrew/opt/llvm/lib/unwind -lunwind"
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7606800Z 
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7607030Z To use the bundled libc++ please use the following LDFLAGS:
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7609350Z   LDFLAGS="-L/opt/homebrew/opt/llvm/lib/c++ -L/opt/homebrew/opt/llvm/lib/unwind -lunwind"
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7611160Z Features newer than system libc++ will require the following define to enable
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7612740Z (support for this may be removed in a future major LLVM release):
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7613920Z   CPPFLAGS="-D_LIBCPP_DISABLE_AVAILABILITY"
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7614570Z 
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7615290Z NOTE: You probably want to use the libunwind and libc++ provided by macOS unless you know what you're doing.
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7616490Z 
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7617090Z llvm is keg-only, which means it was not symlinked into /opt/homebrew,
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7618640Z because macOS already provides this software and installing another version in
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7620550Z parallel can cause all kinds of trouble.
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7621210Z 
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7621690Z If you need to have llvm first in your PATH, run:
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7623250Z   printf '%s\n' export\ PATH\=/opt/homebrew/opt/llvm/bin:\$PATH >> /Users/runner/.bash_profile
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7645560Z 
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7738240Z For compilers to find llvm you may need to set:
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7749480Z   export LDFLAGS=-L/opt/homebrew/opt/llvm/lib
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7750190Z   export CPPFLAGS=-I/opt/homebrew/opt/llvm/include
2026-11-27T18:50:55.7750680Z 
